  Slug: way-of-the-pistolero
  DisplayName: Way of the Pistolero
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/features/classes/way-of-the-pistolero.webp
  Description: Whether you're a professional duelist or a pistol-twirling entertainer,
    you have quick feet and quicker hands that never seem to let you down, and an
    equally sharp wit and tongue that jab your foes. You might leave a hand free
    or cultivate the ambidexterity for twin weapons. Either way, you stay close enough
    to your enemies to leverage your superior reflexes while leaving enough space
    to safely fire. Slinger's Reload @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Raconteur's
    Reload] Deeds Initial @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Ten Paces]; Advanced
    @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Pistolero's Retort]; Greater @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Grim
    Swagger] Way Skill choose Deception or Intimidation
